A||||12||PeaceDawg||Parts car or Project car????||||6||
Z||000000||PeaceDawg||06-14-2001||07:42 PM||||Last weekend I bought a Fiero thinking that it would make a good parts car...the price was right at $350.00 Canadian.  The owner said that it had been parked for the last seven years.  It was parked after his daugher had a baby and he was keeping it for parts for his own Fiero.  Anyways me and a friend towed it back to my place.  I took the battery out of my truck and put it in the Fiero and turned the key...just out of curiosity and it fired right up and it seems to idle nicely.  I am sure that it would need alot of brakework, suspension and who knows what else but now I am thinking that it might be worth fixing up.  I would hate to use it for parts when with a little TLC it might be roadworthy.  What would you do??<BR>It has been sitting for an awfully long time.<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/988.jpg"> ||||reg||6
